They've got mangoes too.

588
00:21:06,400 --> 00:21:07,240
Just like that.

589
00:21:07,260 --> 00:21:07,920
(Imitating)

590
00:21:07,920 --> 00:21:09,040
They've got mangoes too.

591
00:21:09,920 --> 00:21:11,480
You sound so goofy copying me.

592
00:21:12,280 --> 00:21:13,920
Because I'm goofy.

593
00:21:13,920 --> 00:21:14,760
What can I say?

594
00:21:15,180 --> 00:21:16,620
(What am I gonna do with you?)

595
00:21:19,880 --> 00:21:21,520
It's so tiny.

596
00:21:21,520 --> 00:21:22,280
Right?

597
00:21:22,680 --> 00:21:23,640
There's a fork here.

598
00:21:26,000 --> 00:21:27,760
Can you eat a whole one in one bite?

599
00:21:31,800 --> 00:21:32,600
Is it sweet?

600
00:21:35,520 --> 00:21:36,600
So sweet. Try some.

601
00:21:36,600 --> 00:21:38,480
You sound like you're
filming a commercial.

602
00:21:43,240 --> 00:21:44,040
What? You ate the whole thing?

603
00:21:44,040 --> 00:21:45,440
Why does it taste like alcohol?

604
00:21:46,240 --> 00:21:46,720
It's fermented?

605
00:21:46,720 --> 00:21:47,520
I think so too.

606
00:21:48,280 --> 00:21:49,200
Eat all of it.

607
00:21:50,980 --> 00:21:53,140
(Smiles)

608
00:21:53,720 --> 00:21:55,040
This knife's not very good.

609
00:21:56,440 --> 00:21:57,880
It's not meant for cutting fruit.

610
00:21:58,980 --> 00:21:59,660
(Helping to peel)

611
00:21:59,660 --> 00:22:01,840
It doesn't look too pretty, babe.

612
00:22:01,840 --> 00:22:03,000
Don't judge, okay?

613
00:22:03,000 --> 00:22:04,340
(No judgment)
I won't.

614
00:22:04,840 --> 00:22:06,080
Here, hold this napkin.

615
00:22:06,720 --> 00:22:07,800
Hold it underneath.

616
00:22:08,880 --> 00:22:09,520
Passion fruit.

617
00:22:10,000 --> 00:22:11,360
Is this a tangerine or passion fruit?

618
00:22:11,360 --> 00:22:12,160
Tangerine.

619
00:22:14,120 --> 00:22:15,640
A bite of mango,
then a bite of tangerine.

620
00:22:16,600 --> 00:22:17,120
No.

621
00:22:19,420 --> 00:22:20,940
(All in one bite)

622
00:22:23,720 --> 00:22:24,440
So sour.

623
00:22:24,440 --> 00:22:25,700
(Sour)

624
00:22:25,980 --> 00:22:26,610
Oh my God!

625
00:22:27,680 --> 00:22:30,040
This tangerine has so many seeds.

626
00:22:31,600 --> 00:22:32,280
Babe,

627
00:22:32,280 --> 00:22:33,880
I've noticed you're starting to act

628
00:22:33,880 --> 00:22:34,440
like me sometimes.

629
00:22:34,440 --> 00:22:35,840
You look so goofy when you laugh.

630
00:22:35,840 --> 00:22:37,920
I guess my goofiness
is contagious, babe.

631
00:22:37,940 --> 00:22:39,180
(No way)

632
00:22:39,600 --> 00:22:40,800
Let me get you some of this.

633
00:22:41,280 --> 00:22:41,800
Open up.

634
00:22:43,620 --> 00:22:45,900
(Feeding)

635
00:22:46,400 --> 00:22:47,320
You first.

636
00:22:48,300 --> 00:22:49,260
(Teasing)

637
00:22:51,840 --> 00:22:52,680
I don't want it.

638
00:22:55,180 --> 00:22:56,020
(Patting)

639
00:22:58,480 --> 00:22:59,440
I wanna go swimming.

640
00:22:59,640 --> 00:23:00,200
Let's go.

641
00:23:01,040 --> 00:23:01,920
Go ahead and swim.

642
00:23:01,920 --> 00:23:02,800
I'm staying out.

643
00:23:02,800 --> 00:23:03,120
Okay.

644
00:23:05,680 --> 00:23:06,720
Is the water cold?

645
00:23:07,000 --> 00:23:07,800
Nope.

646
00:23:07,800 --> 00:23:08,760
(Checking on him)

647
00:23:08,760 --> 00:23:10,640
We've finally made it...

648
00:23:12,120 --> 00:23:12,920
to our little house.

649
00:23:13,110 --> 00:23:14,760
I'm sitting here watching him

650
00:23:14,760 --> 00:23:15,800
and filming him.

651
00:23:21,240 --> 00:23:22,520
He's swimming right now.

652
00:23:23,740 --> 00:23:25,140
(Knows a little butterfly stroke)

653
00:23:34,080 --> 00:23:35,160
I feel like this pool

654
00:23:35,160 --> 00:23:36,400
is too small for you.

655
00:23:37,160 --> 00:23:38,760
You reached the end in two strokes.

656
00:23:38,760 --> 00:23:39,840
Pretty much.

657
00:23:40,180 --> 00:23:41,420
(Keeps filming)

658
00:23:41,460 --> 00:23:44,300
(Xing's POV)

659
00:23:44,300 --> 00:23:46,100
(Human propeller)

660
00:23:47,460 --> 00:23:49,200
I'm your live commentator.

661
00:23:49,200 --> 00:23:51,680
(Xing's POV)
He just did a somersault underwater.

662
00:24:00,650 --> 00:24:02,160
Let me dry you off.

663
00:24:03,760 --> 00:24:05,020
Rest here for a bit.

664
00:24:07,000 --> 00:24:08,480
Back when I was living at home,

665
00:24:09,240 --> 00:24:10,840
I'd go swimming with my dad.

666
00:24:11,560 --> 00:24:12,480
He loves swimming too.

667
00:24:12,840 --> 00:24:14,280
I'd keep the old man company.

668
00:24:14,720 --> 00:24:15,920
Si could float on her back.

669
00:24:15,920 --> 00:24:17,360
She'd just float in the ocean.

670
00:24:17,360 --> 00:24:18,280
Moving her feet, not her arms.

671
00:24:18,520 --> 00:24:18,840
Really?

672
00:24:18,840 --> 00:24:20,120
I wanted to learn, so she taught me.

673
00:24:20,120 --> 00:24:21,600
But I never got the hang of it.

674
00:24:21,600 --> 00:24:23,200
We were learning breaststroke.

675
00:24:23,200 --> 00:24:25,240
But I was a mischievous kid.

676
00:24:25,240 --> 00:24:25,840
I didn't wanna learn.

677
00:24:25,840 --> 00:24:27,320
I'd just play in the water.

678
00:24:28,040 --> 00:24:29,060
I'll teach you next time.

679
00:24:30,360 --> 00:24:31,440
Let me try diving in.

680
00:24:31,680 --> 00:24:32,680
Jump in.

681
00:24:33,360 --> 00:24:35,080
Then jump into the deep end.

682
00:24:35,360 --> 00:24:36,720
I might embarrass myself.

683
00:24:36,720 --> 00:24:37,360
Don't laugh at me.

684
00:24:37,860 --> 00:24:38,460
I won't.

685
00:24:40,860 --> 00:24:42,060
(Anticipating)

686
00:24:44,340 --> 00:24:46,260
(Freezes)

687
00:24:46,300 --> 00:24:47,340
(Laughs)

688
00:24:48,160 --> 00:24:49,160
I'm getting scared.

689
00:24:49,160 --> 00:24:50,360
You'll be fine.

690
00:24:50,360 --> 00:24:51,680
Just go for it.

691
00:24:51,960 --> 00:24:53,240
Just go for it.

692
00:24:53,240 --> 00:24:54,140
(Takes the plunge)

693
00:25:02,840 --> 00:25:03,640
That was an ugly splash.

694
00:25:04,120 --> 00:25:05,680
I swear, the water just

695
00:25:05,680 --> 00:25:07,280
(The water hits back)
slapped me right across the face.

696
00:25:07,300 --> 00:25:08,980
(Cracks up)

697
00:25:09,200 --> 00:25:10,620
(Checking for brain damage)
That gave me a concussion.

698
00:25:16,580 --> 00:25:18,060
(A new day)

699
00:25:18,520 --> 00:25:19,720
Let's go to the beach.

700
00:25:19,720 --> 00:25:21,160
Let's go.

701
00:25:23,080 --> 00:25:23,720
The ocean!

702
00:25:24,360 --> 00:25:25,120
Look over there!

703
00:25:25,120 --> 00:25:25,640
So high!

704
00:25:27,920 --> 00:25:28,200
Babe!

705
00:25:28,380 --> 00:25:28,720
Babe!

706
00:25:29,080 --> 00:25:29,880
Come on, run!

707
00:25:30,680 --> 00:25:31,400
Wait for me!

708
00:25:31,920 --> 00:25:33,000
Look at that huge grin!

709
00:25:33,600 --> 00:25:34,160
Let me copy you.

710
00:25:36,640 --> 00:25:37,800
You're so annoying!

711
00:25:41,600 --> 00:25:43,130
You're so annoying!

712
00:25:45,120 --> 00:25:46,080
Watch me pick you up!

713
00:25:49,400 --> 00:25:50,360
I'll toss you in!

714
00:26:03,620 --> 00:26:04,660
(Success)

715
00:26:12,440 --> 00:26:13,680
Are you scared, babe?

716
00:26:13,680 --> 00:26:14,480
Nope.

717
00:26:14,480 --> 00:26:15,320
Are you scared?

718
00:26:15,320 --> 00:26:16,280
(Still being mischievous)

719
00:26:16,280 --> 00:26:17,240
Scared yet?

720
00:26:19,560 --> 00:26:20,360
You're annoying!

721
00:26:22,520 --> 00:26:23,000
Babe,

722
00:26:23,240 --> 00:26:24,240
what if I

723
00:26:24,240 --> 00:26:25,080
splashed water on you?

724
00:26:25,080 --> 00:26:26,120
What would happen to me?

725
00:26:26,800 --> 00:26:27,440
I'd actually hit you.

726
00:26:27,440 --> 00:26:28,240
You're doomed.

727
00:26:28,240 --> 00:26:29,360
Doomed again?

728
00:26:30,400 --> 00:26:31,480
I'm doomed every day.

729
00:26:33,260 --> 00:26:34,900
(Wobbling)

730
00:26:35,040 --> 00:26:36,200
Just you wait!

731
00:26:36,680 --> 00:26:37,400
I'll pull out

732
00:26:37,400 --> 00:26:38,120
my secret move

733
00:26:38,120 --> 00:26:39,760
and push you into the ocean.

734
00:26:39,760 --> 00:26:40,720
That's fine.

735
00:26:44,840 --> 00:26:45,880
Getting tired?

736
00:26:45,880 --> 00:26:46,680
I'm okay.

737
00:26:49,240 --> 00:26:50,920
We've paddled pretty far, babe.

738
00:26:52,000 --> 00:26:53,680
This thing moves pretty fast.

739
00:26:54,560 --> 00:26:56,360
I've been paddling
really hard back here.

740
00:26:56,680 --> 00:26:57,720
Aren't you tired?

741
00:26:58,920 --> 00:26:59,360
Nope.

742
00:27:02,560 --> 00:27:02,920
Hey,

743
00:27:02,920 --> 00:27:04,680
if we just drifted with the waves,

744
00:27:04,680 --> 00:27:05,760
where would we end up?

745
00:27:07,400 --> 00:27:08,760
Somewhere mysterious.

746
00:27:11,920 --> 00:27:12,800
Do you think the water

747
00:27:12,800 --> 00:27:14,120
is blue or green?

748
00:27:14,880 --> 00:27:16,640
Water's colorless, babe.

749
00:27:16,640 --> 00:27:18,120
The color you see comes from

750
00:27:18,120 --> 00:27:19,560
the way sunlight scatters.

751
00:27:27,680 --> 00:27:28,600
Let's paddle a bit longer,

752
00:27:28,600 --> 00:27:29,720
then head back.

753
00:27:30,920 --> 00:27:31,960
Let's head toward shore.

754
00:27:31,960 --> 00:27:32,680
Okay.

755
00:27:33,920 --> 00:27:34,640
Straight ahead!

756
00:27:34,640 --> 00:27:36,480
Let's go full speed, okay?

757
00:27:36,480 --> 00:27:37,840
Ready?

758
00:27:39,000 --> 00:27:41,000
Let's go! Two, three!

759
00:27:41,020 --> 00:27:41,900
(Pushing hard)

760
00:27:41,900 --> 00:27:43,420
(Giving it his all)

761
00:27:44,160 --> 00:27:45,080
So fast!

762
00:27:49,440 --> 00:27:50,240
Fast, right, babe?

763
00:27:50,240 --> 00:27:51,160
So fast!

764
00:27:51,160 --> 00:27:51,960
Isn't it?

765
00:27:52,720 --> 00:27:53,400
Yeah!

766
00:27:55,880 --> 00:27:56,720
Anyone watching would think

767
00:27:56,720 --> 00:27:58,480
this thing has a motor!

768
00:28:05,960 --> 00:28:07,000
Let's take a walk.

769
00:28:12,280 --> 00:28:13,720
Your dress is soaked, isn't it?

770
00:28:14,120 --> 00:28:16,040
It's actually a swimsuit.

771
00:28:17,080 --> 00:28:18,560
Here are our shoes.

772
00:28:19,000 --> 00:28:19,800
Say that again.

773
00:28:19,800 --> 00:28:21,000
Xing's right here.

774
00:28:21,240 --> 00:28:22,120
Say it again.

775
00:28:22,120 --> 00:28:22,960
Our shoes are here.

776
00:28:23,120 --> 00:28:23,520
Copy what

777
00:28:23,520 --> 00:28:24,920
you said on the boat.

778
00:28:26,160 --> 00:28:27,200
Xing's right here.

779
00:28:28,600 --> 00:28:29,680
Xing's here.

780
00:28:29,680 --> 00:28:30,880
What did you say after that?

781
00:28:31,960 --> 00:28:32,600
Xing.

782
00:28:33,880 --> 00:28:34,920
That's right!

783
00:28:34,920 --> 00:28:35,760
You remember!

784
00:28:37,320 --> 00:28:38,120
You remember!

785
00:28:55,000 --> 00:28:55,680
Look.

786
00:29:07,720 --> 00:29:08,680
That fridge magnet from last time.

787
00:29:08,680 --> 00:29:09,520
You drew one with

788
00:29:09,520 --> 00:29:10,960
a star inside a tree.

789
00:29:17,680 --> 00:29:18,840
And then like this.

790
00:29:18,840 --> 00:29:19,840
Two little footprints.

791
00:29:27,520 --> 00:29:28,720
We'll need to rinse off later.

792
00:29:28,720 --> 00:29:29,920
We're covered in seawater.

793
00:29:35,320 --> 00:29:36,360
Thanks for everything, Fu.

794
00:29:36,880 --> 00:29:38,360
No problem. Have fun?

795
00:29:38,360 --> 00:29:39,880
It was awesome.

796
00:29:39,880 --> 00:29:40,800
Such a cool experience.

797
00:29:41,880 --> 00:29:42,920
Really awesome.

798
00:29:44,570 --> 00:29:45,000
Man...

799
00:29:45,300 --> 00:29:47,120
I was still half asleep this morning.

800
00:29:47,120 --> 00:29:48,960
Then one wave hit me

801
00:29:48,960 --> 00:29:50,000
and woke me right up.

802
00:29:50,000 --> 00:29:51,360
I think you're a natural, though.

803
00:29:51,560 --> 00:29:52,600
No matter what I say

804
00:29:52,600 --> 00:29:53,120
or what I do,

805
00:29:53,120 --> 00:29:54,520
you always compliment me.

806
00:29:54,520 --> 00:29:55,880
I really think you're a natural.

807
00:29:57,880 --> 00:29:58,560
When we first moved into the house,

808
00:29:58,560 --> 00:30:00,240
the first thing we did was go boating.

809
00:30:00,840 --> 00:30:01,960
We've come full circle.

810
00:30:01,960 --> 00:30:03,080
Full circle.

811
00:30:06,800 --> 00:30:07,680
Finally here.

812
00:30:09,540 --> 00:30:11,220
(Local clothing store)

813
00:30:17,680 --> 00:30:18,840
This one's actually pretty nice.

814
00:30:18,840 --> 00:30:20,080
I think this one's nice too.

815
00:30:23,920 --> 00:30:25,080
I wanna try this one on.

816
00:30:25,080 --> 00:30:25,880
Sure.

817
00:30:27,080 --> 00:30:28,080
You like this one?

818
00:30:28,080 --> 00:30:29,000
Then let's go with it.

819
00:30:29,160 --> 00:30:30,720
Okay, let's try them on.

820
00:30:30,720 --> 00:30:31,520
Okay.

821
00:30:35,360 --> 00:30:36,000
Xing,

822
00:30:36,000 --> 00:30:36,640
I'll count down.

823
00:30:36,640 --> 00:30:37,560
Let's come out together.

824
00:30:38,240 --> 00:30:38,800
Okay.

825
00:30:38,800 --> 00:30:39,600
Three.

826
00:30:39,600 --> 00:30:40,400
Two.

827
00:30:40,400 --> 00:30:40,760
One.

828
00:30:43,460 --> 00:30:44,820
(Smiles)

829
00:30:48,380 --> 00:30:49,020
Oh, wow!

830
00:30:51,360 --> 00:30:52,840
Are you wearing this belt?

831
00:30:55,700 --> 00:30:56,560
(Pinches)

832
00:30:56,560 --> 00:30:57,320
The shop owner said

833
00:30:57,320 --> 00:30:58,920
it's part of the local tradition.

834
00:30:59,640 --> 00:31:01,330
Maybe try a different pants color.

835
00:31:01,840 --> 00:31:02,640
Come here.

836
00:31:02,860 --> 00:31:04,220
(Follows along)

837
00:31:04,800 --> 00:31:05,880
Go over to the mirror

838
00:31:05,880 --> 00:31:06,600
and compare them.

839
00:31:06,980 --> 00:31:08,500
(Follows along)

840
00:31:12,800 --> 00:31:14,760
Would you like gold better?

841
00:31:14,760 --> 00:31:15,400
Gold.

842
00:31:15,400 --> 00:31:17,000
Okay, gold it is.

843
00:31:17,000 --> 00:31:18,040
(Rushes to change)
I'll be quick.

844
00:31:18,040 --> 00:31:18,640
Thirty seconds.

845
00:31:19,520 --> 00:31:20,320
No rush.

846
00:31:20,320 --> 00:31:21,520
I'm getting my makeup done.

847
00:31:26,800 --> 00:31:27,960
How about this, Xing?

848
00:31:30,040 --> 00:31:31,560
That works.

849
00:31:31,560 --> 00:31:32,440
This is better, right?

850
00:31:33,100 --> 00:31:34,140
(Makeover begins)

851
00:31:37,360 --> 00:31:38,320
So pretty.

852
00:31:41,720 --> 00:31:42,440
For everyday looks,

853
00:31:42,440 --> 00:31:44,080
(Makeup artist)
you should try this hairstyle.

854
00:31:44,600 --> 00:31:45,400
With my hair pulled back?

855
00:31:47,560 --> 00:31:48,160
Looks great.

856
00:31:48,160 --> 00:31:49,080
It looks so elegant.

857
00:31:58,120 --> 00:31:59,540
(Headpiece complete)
What a difference.

858
00:31:59,600 --> 00:32:01,760
These accessories are pretty heavy.

859
00:32:06,080 --> 00:32:07,070
Beautiful!

860
00:32:08,180 --> 00:32:10,600
(Makeup artist)

861
00:32:10,600 --> 00:32:12,200
The more we do,
the better she'll photograph.

862
00:32:12,720 --> 00:32:13,520
Exactly.

863
00:32:14,920 --> 00:32:15,680
If I don't dress up a little,

864
00:32:15,680 --> 00:32:17,360
I won't even dare take photos

865
00:32:17,360 --> 00:32:19,080
standing next to you.

866
00:32:19,940 --> 00:32:21,020
(Happy)

867
00:32:21,480 --> 00:32:23,240
I forgot your earrings. I'll grab them.

868
00:32:26,740 --> 00:32:29,060
(Stares)

869
00:32:36,720 --> 00:32:37,760
Want a drink?

870
00:32:37,760 --> 00:32:38,520
Thirsty?

871
00:32:38,520 --> 00:32:39,300
I want some bo...

872
00:32:39,300 --> 00:32:39,740
Some ba...

873
00:32:39,740 --> 00:32:40,200
Some bo...

874
00:32:40,200 --> 00:32:41,320
What's "bo" supposed to mean?

875
00:32:41,720 --> 00:32:42,320
Boba.

876
00:32:43,440 --> 00:32:44,320
Boba.

877
00:32:44,320 --> 00:32:45,480
You've been talking about it for days.

878
00:32:45,480 --> 00:32:46,560
You're really craving boba.

879
00:32:47,090 --> 00:32:48,320
You little foodie.

880
00:32:54,960 --> 00:32:56,760
