Would you

1449
00:57:00,840 --> 00:57:02,000
try luosifen?

1450
00:57:02,000 --> 00:57:02,520
Sure.

1451
00:57:02,520 --> 00:57:04,120
(Luosifen hotpot prepared by Cao Yiheng)
Luosifen in the stargazing room.

1452
00:57:04,120 --> 00:57:05,360
So thoughtful.

1453
00:57:05,360 --> 00:57:06,560
You've done so much.

1454
00:57:07,000 --> 00:57:08,360
Such a one-of-a-kind stargazing room.

1455
00:57:08,460 --> 00:57:09,880
(A one-of-a-kind stargazing room)

1456
00:57:09,880 --> 00:57:11,400
Can you get something for me?

1457
00:57:11,400 --> 00:57:12,680
There's something for stargazing.

1458
00:57:12,680 --> 00:57:14,120
Oh my god!

1459
00:57:14,120 --> 00:57:15,320
(Happy birthday)
Our one-month anniversary.

1460
00:57:15,320 --> 00:57:16,520
Happy anniversary, babe.

1461
00:57:16,520 --> 00:57:17,640
Okay.

1462
00:57:17,640 --> 00:57:18,920
(Happy anniversary)

1463
00:57:18,920 --> 00:57:20,200
(Yu Yang cooking himself)
Celebrating our one-month anniversary.

1464
00:57:20,460 --> 00:57:21,860
(The first bite
for the one who's worked so hard)

1465
00:57:21,960 --> 00:57:22,880
It's delicious.

1466
00:57:23,160 --> 00:57:23,880
Here, have a bite.

1467
00:57:23,940 --> 00:57:25,220
(Feeding each other)
Thank you.

1468
00:57:25,240 --> 00:57:26,280
I feel so happy

1469
00:57:26,280 --> 00:57:28,040
cooking for you at home.

1470
00:57:28,380 --> 00:57:30,140
(Happiness is eating together at home)

1471
00:57:30,480 --> 00:57:31,240
You've worked hard.

1472
00:57:32,120 --> 00:57:33,000
Let me guess.

1473
00:57:33,000 --> 00:57:34,000
(confidential)
This one's obviously you.

1474
00:57:34,000 --> 00:57:34,690
(Sun Bohan's guess)
This one's smiling with her mouth open.

1475
00:57:34,690 --> 00:57:35,480
(Left: Wu Xingying; Right: Wu Siying)
That's obviously Si.

1476
00:57:35,480 --> 00:57:35,960
This one's you.

1477
00:57:35,960 --> 00:57:36,520
This one's Xing.

1478
00:57:36,520 --> 00:57:37,400
(Cui Yihang guessed correctly)
Cui Yihang got it right.

1479
00:57:37,400 --> 00:57:38,160
Si's on the left,

1480
00:57:38,160 --> 00:57:38,720
and you're on the right.

1481
00:57:38,720 --> 00:57:39,360
I guessed the opposite of him.

1482
00:57:39,520 --> 00:57:40,280
(Correct answer: +2)
Cui Yihang got it right.

1483
00:57:40,280 --> 00:57:41,520
I think Si's on the right,

1484
00:57:41,520 --> 00:57:42,200
and Xing's on the left.

1485
00:57:42,280 --> 00:57:43,240
Si's on the left,

1486
00:57:43,240 --> 00:57:43,760
and Xing's on the right.

1487
00:57:43,860 --> 00:57:44,660
(Correct answer: +3)
Cui Yihang got it right.

1488
00:57:44,660 --> 00:57:45,760
It's harder to get them all wrong
than all right.

1489
00:57:45,760 --> 00:57:46,880
So basically, he got them all right.

1490
00:57:59,860 --> 00:58:02,580
♪Morning steam rises
from breakfast stalls♪

1491
00:58:02,580 --> 00:58:05,180
♪Packed subway cars,
barely room to breathe♪

1492
00:58:05,180 --> 00:58:09,380
♪Still half asleep, another day begins♪

1493
00:58:10,540 --> 00:58:13,260
♪The city glows beneath the towers♪

1494
00:58:13,260 --> 00:58:15,900
♪Somewhere beyond the clouds,
a sweet little date awaits♪

1495
00:58:15,900 --> 00:58:19,980
♪But first,
there are endless meetings to survive♪

1496
00:58:20,700 --> 00:58:22,100
♪Even if the fairy tale
only lasts a day♪

1497
00:58:22,100 --> 00:58:23,420
♪I'll still give it everything I have♪

1498
00:58:23,420 --> 00:58:24,740
♪Love out loud♪

1499
00:58:24,740 --> 00:58:26,140
♪Don't let this summer slip away♪

1500
00:58:26,140 --> 00:58:27,380
♪Cupid's arrow is already on its way♪

1501
00:58:27,380 --> 00:58:28,780
♪Don't act like you didn't see it♪

1502
00:58:28,780 --> 00:58:31,740
♪Just be a little braver♪

1503
00:58:31,740 --> 00:58:32,980
♪Keep moving♪

1504
00:58:33,100 --> 00:58:34,580
♪Keep moving♪

1505
00:58:34,580 --> 00:58:37,940
♪There's a little spark shining
in your eyes♪

1506
00:58:40,300 --> 00:58:42,660
♪That's the signal
of a heart coming alive♪

1507
00:58:53,100 --> 00:58:55,900
♪Keep moving♪

1508
00:58:55,900 --> 00:58:58,540
♪Life can be complicated,
yet beautifully simple♪

1509
00:58:58,540 --> 00:59:01,180
♪Go discover♪

1510
00:59:01,180 --> 00:59:03,860
♪That heartbeat you've been longing
to let out♪

1511
00:59:03,860 --> 00:59:06,540
♪Come closer♪

1512
00:59:06,540 --> 00:59:09,940
♪There's a little spark shining
in your eyes♪

1513
00:59:12,380 --> 00:59:15,180
♪That's the signal
of a heart coming alive♪
